      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There's a few members on the team getting PiMax headsets (myself included!). That being said, if it works for SteamVR-- which it does-- it should work reasonably well with VRChat, potentially pending some remapping via SteamVR Input.",
      "viewerReactions": null
