  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-10-24T00:20:30.750Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Is there any chance that VRChat might get a Pimax 4K, 5K & 8K support soon? It helps remove the screen door effect and provides clear screen with a wide FoV. Plus, they even got knuckles styled motion controllers so that you can wear them like brass knuckles and being able to let go of the controller without dropping it. Here's the controllers I was talking about. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mh4U9HZzDGw",
